## Guest stay flow

```
Login
  → Booking (optional)
  → Reservation (check-in + planned checkout + rooms)
  → Food / service / payment while in-house
  → Checkout (room bill is calculated here)
```

- Reservation stores stay dates only. Room **bill / GST / total** stay `null` until checkout.
- After checkout, food order add is rejected.
- Only one active checkout per reservation.

