## Masters

Pattern for most masters:

| Action | Method | Path |
|---|---|---|
| List | `GET` | `/{module}/list` |
| Search | `GET` | `/{module}/search?keyword=` |
| Add | `POST` | `/{module}/add` |
| Update | `PUT` | `/{module}/update/{id}` |
| Delete | `DELETE` | `/{module}/delete/{id}` |

### Room type — `/room-type`

Add:

```json
{
  "room_tname": "Deluxe Cottage",
  "room_charges": 3750,
  "extra_bed_charges": 500
}
```

| Field | Required |
|---|---|
| `room_tname` | Yes |
| `room_charges` | Yes |
| `extra_bed_charges` | No |

List fields: `Room_TId`, `Room_TName`, `Room_Charges`, `Extra_Bed_Charges`, `Status`.

### Room details — `/room-details`

List: optional `?room_type=1`.

Add:

```json
{
  "room_type": 1,
  "room_no": "112",
  "room_desc": "Cottage",
  "adult": 2,
  "child": 1,
  "booking_allowed": 1
}
```

| Field | Required | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `room_type` | Yes | `Room_TId` from room type |
| `room_no` | Yes | |
| `adult` | Yes | min 1 |
| `room_desc` | No | |
| `child` | No | |
| `booking_allowed` | No | `1` = can reserve, `0` = blocked. Default `1`. Master flag only; reservation does not change it. |

### Price manager — regular — `/price-manager/regular`

One regular rate per room type.

```json
{
  "room_tid": 1,
  "rate_mon": 3750,
  "rate_tue": 3750,
  "rate_wed": 3750,
  "rate_thu": 3750,
  "rate_fri": 4000,
  "rate_sat": 4500,
  "rate_sun": 4500
}
```

All weekday rates are required.

### Price manager — special — `/price-manager/special`

```json
{
  "room_tid": 1,
  "event_name": "Durga Pujo 2026",
  "date_from": "2026-10-17",
  "date_upto": "2026-10-21",
  "rate_spl": 4250
}
```

Date ranges for the same room type cannot overlap.

### Menu category — `/menu-category`

```json
{ "categ_name": "Breakfast" }
```

Category name is unique.

### Menu details — `/menu-details`

List: optional `?category_id=1`. Use `Item_Id` as `menu_id` on food orders.

```json
{
  "category_id": 1,
  "menu_code": 101,
  "menu_name": "Toast Butter/Jam",
  "menu_shortnm": "Toast",
  "menu_desc": "4 Pcs",
