| Field | Required |
|---|---|
| `category_id` | Yes |
| `menu_name` | Yes |
| `rate` | Yes |
| `menu_code` / `menu_shortnm` / `menu_desc` | No |

Menu name is unique per category. `menu_code` is unique.

