## Booking

Number format: `DDYY####` (example `19260001`). Financial year starts 1 April.

| Action | Method | Path |
|---|---|---|
| List | `GET` | `/booking/list` |
| Details | `GET` | `/booking/details/{bookingNo}` |
| Add | `POST` | `/booking/add` |
| Update | `PUT` | `/booking/update/{bookingId}` |
| Cancel | `PUT` | `/booking/cancel/{bookingId}` |

List returns bookings created by the logged-in user. Details uses **booking number**, update/cancel use **booking id**.

Add:

```json
{
  "guest_name": "Rajesh Kumar",
  "contact_no": "9876543210",
  "room_tid": 1,
  "no_of_room": 2,
  "checkin_date": "2026-10-01",
  "stay_duration": 3,
  "exp_chkout_dt": "2026-10-04",
  "agent_id": null,
  "note": "Early check-in requested"
}
```

| Field | Required | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `guest_name` | Yes | |
| `contact_no` | Yes | max 15 |
| `room_tid` | Yes | room type, not a room |
| `no_of_room` | Yes | |
| `checkin_date` | Yes | |
| `stay_duration` | Yes | nights |
| `exp_chkout_dt` | No | auto = check-in + stay duration |
| `agent_id` | No | |
| `note` | No | |

Booking does **not** allot a physical room. That happens on reservation.

