## Payment

Writes a collection against a reservation.

| Action | Method | Path |
|---|---|---|
| List | `GET` | `/payment/list` optional `?reservation_no=` |
| Details | `GET` | `/payment/details/{collectionId}` |
| Add | `POST` | `/payment/add` |
| Update | `PUT` | `/payment/update/{collectionId}` |
| Delete | `DELETE` | `/payment/delete/{collectionId}` |

Add (Body = **raw JSON**):

```json
{
  "reservation_no": "19260001",
  "coll_date": "2026-10-01",
  "coll_amount": 500,
  "coll_mode": 1,
  "final_coll": false
}
```

| Field | Required | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `reservation_no` | Yes | |
| `coll_amount` | Yes | number, min `0.01` |
| `coll_mode` | Yes | integer, min `1` |
| `coll_date` | No | defaults today |
| `final_coll` | No | boolean |

