## Food order

GST is calculated on the server (`FoodBill_GST`).

`Order_Status`: `0` Not delivered, `1` Delivered.

| Action | Method | Path |
|---|---|---|
| List | `GET` | `/food-order/list` optional `?reservation_no=` |
| Details | `GET` | `/food-order/details/{foodOrdId}` |
| Add | `POST` | `/food-order/add` |
| Update | `PUT` | `/food-order/update/{foodOrdId}` |
| Delete | `DELETE` | `/food-order/delete/{foodOrdId}` |

Add:

```json
{
  "reservation_no": "19260001",
  "order_date": "2026-10-01",
  "order_time": "14:30",
  "room_service": true,
  "room_id": 1,
  "special_ins": "Less spicy",
  "items": [
    { "menu_id": 1, "quantity": 2 },
    { "menu_id": 2, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}
```

| Field | Required | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `reservation_no` | Yes | |
| `items` | Yes | at least one |
| `items.*.menu_id` | Yes | `Item_Id` from menu-details |
| `items.*.quantity` | Yes | min 1 |
| `order_date` / `order_time` | No | |
| `room_service` | No | boolean |
| `room_id` | No | |
| `special_ins` | No | max 100 |

If the reservation is already checked out:

```json
{
  "Error_Code": 1,
  "Message": "Reservation already checked out.",
  "data": null
}
```

Mark delivered:

```json
{
  "order_status": 1,
  "delivered_by": 1,
  "special_ins": "Delivered"
}
```

