## Checkout

This is where the **room bill** is calculated (regular / special rates + extra bed + GST). It writes amounts on allotted rooms and creates the checkout bill.

Bill number format: `B` + `DDYY####` (example `B18260001`).

| Action | Method | Path |
|---|---|---|
| Summary | `GET` | `/checkout/summary?reservation_no=` |
| List | `GET` | `/checkout/list` optional `?reservation_no=` |
| Details | `GET` | `/checkout/details/{checkoutId}` |
| Add | `POST` | `/checkout/add` |
| Cancel | `DELETE` | `/checkout/delete/{checkoutId}` |

Call summary before checkout to preview room + food + service + payments.

Add:

```json
{
  "reservation_no": "19260001",
  "checkout_date": "2026-10-03"
}
```

| Field | Required | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `reservation_no` | Yes | |
| `checkout_date` | No | defaults today; must be after check-in |

Checkout date on this API is the **actual** checkout. Reservation `checkout_date` was only the planned stay.

Only one active checkout per reservation. Cancel sets `Status = 0`.

